WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.476
Ok so you’re really excited about Rogue One,

00:00:02.476 --> 00:00:08.008
but when you watch the trailer you only recognize Darth Vader and this lady whose weird name you can’t remember.  

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.509
It’s Mon Mothma 

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.262
Here’s the rundown on the characters you don’t know yet.

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:15.129
Caution. The spoilers are strong with this one.

00:00:18.207 --> 00:00:23.089
Jyn Erso was born in captivity while her parents were prisoners of the Separatist Army,

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:26.698
they are freed for a bit, but then captured again when she is 15 years old. 

00:00:26.698 --> 00:00:29.762
As a result she becomes a criminal badass. 

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:32.203
Like other Star Wars protagonists, 

00:00:32.203 --> 00:00:36.366
Jyn’s daddy issues get her recruited by the rebel alliance,

00:00:37.006 --> 00:00:42.496
Galen Erso is Jyn’s father and also, kinda the Elon Musk of the Star Wars Universe,

00:00:42.496 --> 00:00:47.024
but instead of Electric Cars, his scientific specialty is kyber crystals

00:00:47.207 --> 00:00:52.605
Kyber crystals can be used to magnify energy and are basically the engine in lightsabers.

00:00:52.605 --> 00:00:55.942
The Empire captures Galen because they want to use his expertise

00:00:55.942 --> 00:00:58.687
to make something a little bigger, than a lightsaber.

00:00:58.687 --> 00:01:00.379
Galen Erso: "Say you understand."

00:01:00.379 --> 00:01:01.568
Jyn Erso: "I understand."

00:01:01.568 --> 00:01:04.588
Orson Krennic is the Director of Advanced Weapons Research

00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:07.058
tasked with creating the Death Star’s Superlaser,

00:01:07.058 --> 00:01:10.489
nd he needs help if he is going to get promoted to a rank people don’t question

00:01:10.489 --> 00:01:13.874
 second adult man wearing a cape on the same space station.

00:01:13.874 --> 00:01:15.932
Orson and Galen went to school together

00:01:15.932 --> 00:01:19.134
and Orson uses that connection to manipulate Galen,

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:24.029
into taking a position researching Kyber crystal as a “renewable energy source,” 

00:01:24.029 --> 00:01:25.127
What is it renewing?

00:01:25.127 --> 00:01:28.832
which, unbeknownst to Galen, is actually powering a giant planet killing laser. 

00:01:31.256 --> 00:01:37.554
Saw Gerrera is the one that flies the Erso family to safety from Krennic all those years ago,  

00:01:37.614 --> 00:01:39.704
and Jyn still sees him as a friend. 

00:01:39.704 --> 00:01:43.514
Saw is the leader of a resistance group on Jedha known as the Partisans,

00:01:43.514 --> 00:01:46.991
who become one of the first cells to join the rebel alliance.

00:01:46.991 --> 00:01:49.810
During the Clone Wars, he was subjected to torture, 

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:52.208
which may explain his … poor footing. 

00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:54.435
Saw Gerrera: "The world is coming undone." 

00:01:54.435 --> 00:01:56.079
Ok I don't think that joke was that bad. 

00:01:56.079 --> 00:01:59.218
Joinging Jyn on her mission is Captain Cassian Andor.

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:02.771
He’s an Intelligence Officer in the Alliance to Restore the Republic. 

00:02:02.771 --> 00:02:05.836
Cassian is more on the practical side to Jyn’s radical. 

00:02:05.836 --> 00:02:11.061
He recruits for the rebels and apparently deletes the memory of Imperial droids in his free time,

00:02:11.061 --> 00:02:13.091
which I consider to be a handy hobby. 

00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:14.091
Cassian Andor: "Good" 

00:02:14.091 --> 00:02:17.700
Take C3P0s lack of a social filter and love of statistics,

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:23.015
and mix in Chewbaca's ability to rip peoples arms off, and you've got K-2S0

00:02:23.015 --> 00:02:26.777
Originally created to fight in the Galactic Empire’s armed forces, 

00:02:26.777 --> 00:02:31.481
this Imperial Enforcer droid provides protection and some comic relief. 

00:02:31.481 --> 00:02:33.080
K-2SO- " I will not kill you."

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:36.372
Chirrut Imwe is a blind, staff wielding, warrior monk.

00:02:36.372 --> 00:02:39.564
He was born on Jedha, the ancient home of the Jedi religion 

00:02:39.564 --> 00:02:44.503
and although he isn’t force sensitive himself he is fiercely devoted to its principles.

00:02:44.503 --> 00:02:49.241
As we’ve seen fighting blind is hard even for people that have a high midichlorian count, 

00:02:49.241 --> 00:02:52.588
but I would say this guy’s only disability is that he is a bit too brave. 

00:02:52.588 --> 00:02:56.000
Chirrut Îmwe- "All is as the Force wills it."

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.909
Baze Malbus is Chirrut’s BFF with a BFG. 

00:02:59.909 --> 00:03:04.793
Like his bestie he grew up on Jedha, but Baze isn’t the spiritual type.

00:03:04.793 --> 00:03:08.601
He’s a freelance assassin with a trademark Heavy repeater cannon

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:10.706
and he’s pretty good with other weapons too.

00:03:10.706 --> 00:03:12.677
He is a dude who kills people for a living  

00:03:12.677 --> 00:03:15.912
and something the Empire did has gotten him pretty pissed off. 

00:03:15.912 --> 00:03:17.219
 wonder what that could be...

00:03:17.219 --> 00:03:19.109
Baze Malbus- "They destroyed our home!" 

00:03:19.109 --> 00:03:23.701
Bodhi Rook is the pilot of Rogue One and he has a lot in common with many of his teammates.

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:26.187
Like Baze and Chirrut, he is from Jedha,

00:03:26.187 --> 00:03:28.010
like Jyn he is a little hot headed, 

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.863
and like K2SO he used work for the empire.

00:03:30.863 --> 00:03:35.480
He was an imperial cargo pilot which isn’t quite glamorous, (It's kinda like a truck driver)

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.493
but he’s got his radio communication game down. 

00:03:38.493 --> 00:03:39.453
Bodhi Rook- "Rogue."

00:03:39.483 --> 00:03:42.881
Some other character honorable mentions are Rebel Admiral Raddus,

00:03:42.881 --> 00:03:44.981
Generals Draven and  Merrick, 

00:03:44.981 --> 00:03:48.069
Partisan soldiers Edrio and Benthic Two tubes (Brothers), 

00:03:48.069 --> 00:03:49.914
Gigoran Mercenary Moroff, 

00:03:49.914 --> 00:03:51.251
Rebel soldier Pao,

00:03:51.251 --> 00:03:54.452
and U wing door gunner, Bistan the freaking space monkey. 

00:03:54.452 --> 00:03:56.702
This movie is going to be amazing.

00:03:56.702 --> 00:04:01.057
